{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1034331-recommendation-for-a-good-ereader-for-pdfs","id":1034331,"title":"Recommendation for a Good Ereader for PDFs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-18T17:05:13-08:00","id":1034331,"title":"Recommendation for a Good Ereader for PDFs","content":"So I'm getting back into RPGs and CoD games and I love that you can get the books in PDF form for cheaper than the cost of a printed book, but I absolutely hate reading at a computer or on a tablet. It's not comfortable to sit at a desk and read, and I don't appreciate the screens on tablets. I have an ereader that I love (Kobo Aura), but it is terrible at rendering PDFs. Does anyone have a recommendation on an ereader that renders PDFs well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12885-e11even-e11even","name":"E11even-E11even","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12885_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-18T19:24:38-08:00","id":1034409,"title":"","content":"I've got a Kindle Paperwhite that isn't good at it. I usually cut n paste all the text into a txt file and convert it over. The Kickstarter Google Drive files have been great for it, as without comprehensive editing just dragging pdf text into an editor leaves a lot of chopped up words and some misplaced sections.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"